[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12240.55, "timestamp": "03:24:00", "text": "いつか全エピソードを観るつもりだ。こんにちは。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12244.389, "timestamp": "03:24:04", "text": "うん。私も。私は最新情報を入手しなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12247.23, "timestamp": "03:24:07", "text": "これだよ。はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12248.469, "timestamp": "03:24:08", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12267.83, "timestamp": "03:24:27", "text": "でも私は悲しかったのは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12270.229, "timestamp": "03:24:30", "text": "そこには何もありませんでした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12283.269, "timestamp": "03:24:43", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12286.229, "timestamp": "03:24:46", "text": "それ、すごく好き。私はそれが大好きです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12289.03, "timestamp": "03:24:49", "text": "人々は私の動物リストを使用し、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12292.71, "timestamp": "03:24:52", "text": "フォームやレビューなど"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12294.87, "timestamp": "03:24:54", "text": "あれら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12297.15, "timestamp": "03:24:57", "text": "えーと、その他諸々。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12298.71, "timestamp": "03:24:58", "text": "[音楽]"}]